  "explanation": "The question asks when the PMK (Pattali Makkal Katchi) was founded. Document D1S4 explicitly states that 'PMK was founded by S. Ramadoss, an activist, on 16 July 1989.' This directly supports the claim that the PMK was founded on 16 July 1989. The other candidate, '1981,' refers to the founding year of the People's Movement of Kosovo (LPK) in document D2S1 and D2S4, which is a distinct entity and unrelated to the PMK in Tamil Nadu. Therefore, '1981' is not relevant to the question and should be removed."
